MANUAL_ONLY=true
TITLE=E2E-73: Billing — free-tier exhaustion blocks reviews
TAGS=billing,correctness
MODE=dynamo
BODY=On a fresh installation with no payment method, burn the 5 lifetime free reviews (FREE_REVIEW_LIMIT) and confirm the 6th PR is blocked before the LLM call with no ReviewCostRecord, that the pause notification fires exactly once, that MCP returns -32002, and that topping the balance above MIN_BALANCE_CENTS resumes reviews without a restart. No fixture PR.
